title: Recycling3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha's recycling bag on the landing (Hotspots layer). On the second
// Thursday it's the wine clue she left for him.
-> Look
    <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked>>
        You: Her recycling. Last Thursday's bottle, right on top.
        You: Red Fox. The 2021.
        <<set $r1_thu2_bottle_seen to true>>
        <<note thu2_wine "She drinks Red Fox. The 2021.">>
    <<else>>
        You: Her recycling. Folded flat and sorted. Of course it is.
    <<endif>>
-> Take the bottle <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked>>
    You: I'm not going through her rubbish.
===
